# .clinerules — pointer only

Your operating rules for this repository are the numbered Markdown files in
`.devagent/rules/`. **Read all of them, in numeric order, before taking any action.**

Rule `03-pre-action-reads.md` indexes the skills in `.devagent/skills/`; read the
matching skill before each task. New operators: offer to walk them through
`AGENT_GREETING.md`.

This file deliberately contains no rules of its own, so it can never drift from
`.devagent/rules/`. (ZooCode/Roo loads the same files automatically via `.roo/rules`.)
